.SH "نام (NAME)"
pastebinit \- command\-line pastebin client
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBpastebinit\fR\ 'u
\fBpastebinit\fR [\fB\-abfhiljmrtup\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This manual page documents briefly the
\fBpastebinit\fR
commands
.PP
\fBpastebinit\fR
reads text and sends it to a "pastebin" on the internet, returning the URL to the user\&.
.PP
It allows the text to be passed through a pipe (|) or from files as arguments\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Optional arguments (not supported by all pastebins)"
.PP
\fB\-a \fR\fB[author]\fR (default: $USER)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-b \fR\fB[pastebin\ url]\fR (default is distro\-specific with a fallback to pastebin\&.com)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-E\fR Print the content to stdout too
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-f \fR\fB[format\ for\ syntax\-highlighting]\fR (default: text) (check pastebin\*(Aqs website for complete list, example: python)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-h\fR Help screen
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-i \fR\fB[filename]\fR Use filename for input
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-l\fR List all the supported pastebins
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-j \fR\fB[jabberid]\fR (default: none)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-m \fR\fB[permatag]\fR (default: none)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-t \fR\fB[title\ of\ paste]\fR (default: none)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-P \fR\fB[private]\fR (default: 1)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-u \fR\fB[username]\fR (default: none)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-p \fR\fB[password]\fR (default: none)
.RS 4
.RE
.PP
\fB\-v\fR Version number
.RS 4
.RE
.SH "CONFIGURATION FILE"
.PP
If a \&.pastebinit\&.xml file is found in the user\*(Aqs home directory, pastebinit will use it for its configuration\&.
.PP
Here\*(Aqs an example file:

 <pastebinit>
     <pastebin>https://paste\&.ubuntu\&.com</pastebin>
     <author>Stephane Graber</author>
     <jabberid>stgraber@stgraber\&.org</jabberid>
     <format>text</format>
 </pastebinit>
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
